<title>USA: Cosmetic Group sees significant Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>Cosmetic Group sees significant Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SUN VALLEY, Calif. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmetic Group USA said Wednesday it expects to report a significant loss for the second quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>It said the loss will result from an operating loss from its Zegarelli hair care business and a substantially reduced profit on its contract packaging business. Results for the two businesses will be reported separately since the company is planning to sell its contract packaging assets.</p>
</text>
